ed_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"nTPTqC40pXELp3LOrCtXIA","review_id":"tcGlwoTD0eeA3pMv7oUc1Q","date":"2018-08-15T17:11:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9375919103622437,"text_excerpt":"First experience at Goldbergs was pretty good. I ordered an espresso which came out warm, not hot but was still really tasty. We never got spoons which I found a total oversight by the mgmt, they should be wrapped with the silverware. Y'all are a diner, people need spoons with their coffee - don't put that on the servers. Speaking of the servers, I found them to be very nice and they seemed like a great team! I got a tasty omelette with mushrooms, spinach, turkey sausage and Parmesan cheese. It was big and cooked perfectly! The everything bagel (with caraway seeds which isn't the way they do it in NY but I digress) was pretty good but barely toasted. Bagels could be toasted more. The star..."},{"business_id":"nTPTqC40pXELp3LOrCtXIA","review_id":"7RLHyAVC7qWMY8zz5OwT9Q","date":"2018-12-29T15:10:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.922248363494873,"text_excerpt":"Really enjoyed a late dinner breakfast here last night. Breakfast items were good and large portions (I enjoyed breakfast flatbread very much) Jose was our server and he was excellent- very helpful and friendly for our party of 6! No crowded - no waiting. We are staying at The Roosevelt so will probably go back for bagels before we leave town!"},{"business_id":"nTPTqC40pXELp3LOrCtXIA","review_id":"fmnPmL5LaQgqWph4m2GC1w","date":"2019-06-25T03:18:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9126219153404236,"text_excerpt":"Live around the corner and the first time we ate here . This was just a little over a month ago. Went about 1:30 able to sit anywhere . Our server Todd, was terrific . He was very informative about hours and the menu. . I had a classic burger and Bloody Mary . Excellent on both counts . Husband had a Ruben and a draft beer . His was tasty as well. I tell ya, I certainly will be back . I also like it when employees of a business look like they enjoy working with each other. Went again and had an excellent breakfast flatbread . Once again we had Todd as a server . Went there again and it was closed ! Just like that ! Closed . Not sure if I should give it one star for not letting customers o..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nTPTqC40pXELp3LOrCtXIA","photo_id":"8A5HeN3vqsr8yvV0fXjrUg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8A5HeN3vqsr8yvV0fXjrUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8937031030654907},{"business_id":"nTPTqC40pXELp3LOrCtXIA","photo_id":"WmS03xcdb8wbH8192DiVJQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WmS03xcdb8wbH8192DiVJQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.807542622089386},{"business_id":"nTPTqC40pXELp3LOrCtXIA","photo_id":"iLHmDlxzj82d7ve5VX_dhg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/iLHmDlxzj82d7ve5VX_dhg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7954555153846741},{"business_id":"nTPTqC40pXELp3LOrCtXIA","photo_id":"j7f80YulfQxNRObdZUKCqA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/j7f80YulfQxNRObdZUKCqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7873457074165344},{"business_id":"